Versus 「対戦モード, '''Versus'''」is a playable game mode that is unlocked after clearing [[Cambodia (Empire of Cats)|Cambodia]] from the [[Empire of Cats]] chapter. This game mode offers two different options with the first being Single-Screen 「おすそわけ」in which it is possible for two players to play on one console, and Local Play 「ローカル通信 」 where there are two consoles that are connected together in a local area. Versus was initially introduced in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.4 Update|Version 1.0.4]] in the '''Japanese''' ('''JP''') version of [[The Battle Cats Unite!]] then subsequently was made available during the launch dates of the '''Southeast Asia''' ('''SEA''') and '''International''' ('''WW''') versions.

This game mode offers slightly different content from the [[The Battle Cats POP!|Nintendo 3DS]] and [[Minna de Nyanko Daisensou|PC Browser]] versions but ultimately plays the same as the goal is to take out the opponent's Cat Base health by attacking the base or destroying units.

==Overview==
Versus Mode is a unique game mode in which you are battling against another player to see who can take down the other's health points down to zero. This is possible by attacking the enemy's cats or base. The most notable features are the Trait Cannon and Power Level. The Trait Cannon has the ability to inflict damage and apply a trait (e.g. Red, Dark, Floating) on the opposing side. It also has the ability to stun the enemy when hitting the Cat Base so that they are unable to deploy units for a short amount of time. The Power Level represents the value of each unit and corresponds to the health of the player's Cat Base. Each unit has their own power level, so it is important to strategize the best possible lineup that is the least riskiest.

==Mechanics==
===Settings===
Before going into the match, there are a few settings the player can set before brawling with their opponent. The Cat Base is the only aspect that is not configurable, having it set to 15,000 HP. 
<tabber>
Stage Size=
Stage Size 「ステージサイズ」 Players can choose up to five different stage sizes to fight against:
*Small 「小」: Stage length is 3600 units.
*Medium 「中」: Stage length is 4200 units.
*Large 「大」: Stage length is 5000 units.
*Huge 「特大」: Stage length is 5800 units.
*Random 「ランダム」: Stage size is chosen from any of the choices above.
|-|
Time Limit=
Time Limit 「制限時間」 Players can choose up to how long they want to fight against:
*90 Sec. 「90秒」.
*3 Min. 「3分」.
*5 Min. 「5分」.
*No Limit 「無劼限」: Battle goes on until either base has been defeated.
|-|
Level Adjust=
Level Adjust 「しベル合わせ」 Players can adjust the lineups levels they want to use to fight against:
*None 「なし」: Cat Units stay the same level from single player/co-op progress.
*Level 10 「レべル10」: Cat Unit levels are set to 10.
*Level 20 「レべル20」: Cat Unit levels are set to 20.
*Level 30 「レべル30」: Cat Unit levels are set to 30.
|-|
Team Limits=
Team Limits「強制編成」 Players choose from a different type of formation available:
*OFF「OFF」: No formation changes.
*Random「ランダム」: - Lineup is randomised with the Cat Units that have been obtained during single player/co-op progress.
*Auto-Equip「ねまかせ」: Lineup is randomised with the Cat Units that have been obtained during single player/co-op progress with also granting special effects that affect Cat Units stats.
</tabber>

===Trait Cannon===
The Cat Cannon is replaced with the Trait Cannon in which it can damage Cat Units and the Cat Base as well as applying one of the following traits:
*[[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] 「赤」.
*[[:Category:Dark Enemies|Black]] 「黒」.
*[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] 「浮」.
*[[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] 「メタル」.
*[[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] 「天」.
*[[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] 「エ」.
*[[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]]「ゾンビ」.
If the player's lineup has no trait targeting Cat Units, the Trait Cannon will list none and inflict no trait.

