===End Results===
When a player defeats an opposing Cat Unit the enemies Power Gauge will lose health.
Players are also shown statistics at the end of the battle when the timer ends or when a player wins:
*Power Level「戦効」.
*Trait Mastery「属性マスタ」.
*Area Control「進軍距離」.
*Damage Done「ボコリ度」.
*Deployed「出撃数」.
At the end of every battle, players are able to choose three options:
*Play Again!!「再戦する!!」: Battle again while keeping the same restrictions.
*Change Rules 「ルール・輪成を変更する!!」: Battle again but change the restrictions.
*Return to Base「ネコ基地に戻る」: Return back to the main menu.

